# Custom FLOCK Implementation in C

This project implements a file-locking mechanism in C using a custom `flock()` system based on file descriptors.

✅ Supports LOCK_SH / LOCK_EX / LOCK_UN / LOCK_NB  
✅ Text-based lock storage in C:\flock  
✅ Process list stored per fd with shared/exclusive ownership  
✅ Safe release via flock_clear(pid) on process exit  

This is a low-level, memory-efficient implementation designed for educational and real-world locking simulations.